  "title": "Emergentist panpsychism",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "92f956de-40f9-4d7a-b21e-b9db6fb5c62f",
      "text": "Emergentist panpsychism holds that human and animal minds are brought into being and causally sustained by micro-level conscious goings on, as a genuine addition in being, rather than grounded in them. It is the main form of nonconstitutive panpsychism.",
